<title>POLAND: Swarzedz falls on PLN 28.5 mln Sept loss.</title>
<headline>Swarzedz falls on PLN 28.5 mln Sept loss.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish furniture maker Swarzedz SA, Friday's biggest main market loser, fell 7.7 percent to 7.2 zlotys in thin 0.1-million-zloty trade after showing a September loss of 28.5 million zlotys, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;It's obviously the market's reaction for the huge loss and the stock is likely to fall further and in higher turnover,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Swarzedz reported a loss of 28.5 million zlotys in September and a loss of 34.1 million zlotys in the January-September period.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
